-- הודעת תכ"ם HOD.13.4.2.1 "לוח תעריפי נסיעה בתחבורה ציבורית", מהדורה 19
-- (1.5.2025). Most of the notice rewritten (its table of changes): the
-- allowance at the monthly free pass "משולב מלא" (bus, train, light rail
-- and cable car), the equalisation supplement of existing monthly employees
-- and its yearly reduction, a move of address, trips on duty up to the
-- daily pass "משולב חלקי" or "משולב מלא", and reporting in Malam Payroll
-- and SAP Payroll (annex B). The table of tariffs is DATA here, written by
-- tools/tariff_l4.py from the corpus and held to it by tests/test_tariffs.py.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT conventions
IMPORT parties
IMPORT vocabulary
IMPORT `kitzuvat-nesia-common`
IMPORT `taarifei-nesia-common`

-- not weighed against `the Wage Protection Law`: the notice sets the
-- tariffs by which a travel EXPENSE is refunded (‘החזר בגין הוצאות’) and
-- the supplement that softens its cut, not wages.

-- not weighed against `the Hours of Work and Rest Law`: ‘ימי עבודה בשישי
-- שבת’ (annex B's table) names the payroll symbol for those days' fares,
-- not the hours of work and rest.

§ `הודעת תכ"ם 13.4.2.1 לוח תעריפי נסיעה בתחבורה ציבורית — מהדורה 19`

`notice 19 is published` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 5 2025

§§ `1 רקע ומטרה`

-- 1.1: from 1.8.2022 the tariffs differ by the distance between origin and
-- destination and by the means (bus, train, light rail, cable car, or a
-- partial or full combined card).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1/p2
`the reform notice 19 applies from` MEANS DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2022

-- akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-2 A pointer to the Ministry of Transport's page on the reform; no rule.
-- akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-3 akn:hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-3/p2 The notice's purpose; no rule.

§§ `2.1 כללי`

-- akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1 The heading "כללי"; its clauses follow.

-- 2.1.1 and 2.1.3: the refund is the relevant tariff, by the code reported
-- for the distance between home and work as the Derech Shava calculator
-- gives it: the monthly free pass "משולב מלא" (annex B's table); some
-- employees are paid the equalisation supplement besides (2.2).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-3
`the card notice 19 pays by` MEANS `full combined`

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-3
GIVEN km IS A NUMBER @desc the distance between home and work the calculator gives
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `notice 19's monthly allowance for the distance` km IS
    `the fare for the distance` `notice 19's fares` km `a monthly free pass` `the card notice 19 pays by`

-- 2.1.2: on taking in an employee or a change of address or workplace, the
-- salary accountant enters the calculator and reports the symbol with the
-- tariff code (annex B).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-1__cls_2-1-2
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tariff-notice duty`
DECIDE `finding and reporting the code, notice 19` IS
    PARTY `the salary accountant`
    MUST  `find the route's tariff code or distance on the Ministry of Transport's calculator`
    HENCE (PARTY `the salary accountant`
           MUST  `report the route's tariff code in the payroll`)

§§ `2.2 תשלום תוספת השוואה לעובדים זכאים`

-- 2.2.1 and annex A: the supplement is paid to existing monthly employees
-- alone: a monthly employee employed in a ministry or an auxiliary unit on
-- 31.7.2022; so is one employed that day whose employment was broken
-- afterwards for up to 6 months and resumed, or who moved to another
-- ministry or auxiliary unit, or home. A new employee is one taken in from
-- 1.8.2022. An hourly employee is not entitled to it (2.2.1.5).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-5 akn:att_1__hc_1/p1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1__cls_1-1-1 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1__cls_1-1-2 akn:att_1__hc_1__para_2
GIVEN `a monthly employee` IS A BOOLEAN
      `employed on 31.7.2022` IS A BOOLEAN
      `months the employment was broken since` IS A NUMBER @desc 0 where it never was
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `owed the equalisation supplement under notice 19` `a monthly employee` `employed on 31.7.2022` `months the employment was broken since` IF
    `a monthly employee` AND `employed on 31.7.2022` AND `months the employment was broken since` AT MOST 6

-- 2.2.1.1-2.2.1.4: where the allowance before the reform was below the new
-- tariff, the new tariff (2.2.1.1); where the reform cut it by up to 60
-- shekels against the highest of 2022 on the same route, the new tariff,
-- no supplement (2.2.1.2); by more than 60, the supplement by the table: X
-- (every component, the supplements of earlier reforms included) less the
-- reductions made, and no lower than the row's floor (2.2.1.3); and every
-- August a further 60, up to the row's maximal cumulative reduction
-- (2.2.1.4). The table sits under 2.2.1.2 and is 2.2.1.3's; 2.2.1.4 calls it
-- "the table of section 2.2.3", the place it had until edition 18.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-3 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-3/p2 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-4
GIVEN x IS A NUMBER @desc the allowance paid before the reform, every component included
      `the new tariff` IS A NUMBER
      `the highest allowance of 2022` IS A NUMBER @desc on the same route
      d IS A DATE @desc the month's day
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
DECIDE `notice 19's equalisation supplement` x `the new tariff` `the highest allowance of 2022` d IS
    IF `the highest allowance of 2022` MINUS `the new tariff` AT MOST `the cut notice 19 pays no supplement for`
    THEN JUST 0
    ELSE `the equalisation supplement by the table` `notice 19's equalisation table` x `the new tariff` (`the reductions notice 19 has made by` d)

`the cut notice 19 pays no supplement for` MEANS 60

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-4
GIVEN d IS A DATE
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the reductions notice 19 has made by` d IS
    BRANCH
        IF NOT d `is on or after` (DATE_FROM_DMY 1 8 2022) THEN 0
        IF DATE_MONTH d AT LEAST 8 THEN DATE_YEAR d MINUS 2021
        OTHERWISE DATE_YEAR d MINUS 2022

-- tariff data akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-2/t1 (tools/tariff_l4.py)
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-2__cls_2-2-1__pnt_2-2-1-2/t1
`notice 19's equalisation table` MEANS
    LIST `an equalisation row` 1450 NOTHING (JUST 350) (JUST 1100) (JUST 60),
         `an equalisation row` 1300 (JUST 1450) (JUST 340) (JUST 980) (JUST 60),
         `an equalisation row` 1150 (JUST 1300) (JUST 320) (JUST 850) (JUST 60),
         `an equalisation row` 1000 (JUST 1150) (JUST 300) (JUST 730) (JUST 60),
         `an equalisation row` 850 (JUST 1000) (JUST 270) (JUST 610) (JUST 60),
         `an equalisation row` 750 (JUST 850) (JUST 240) (JUST 550) (JUST 60),
         `an equalisation row` 650 (JUST 750) (JUST 200) (JUST 490) (JUST 60),
         `an equalisation row` 550 (JUST 650) (JUST 160) (JUST 430) (JUST 60),
         `an equalisation row` 0 (JUST 550) (JUST 120) NOTHING (JUST 60)

§§ `2.3 קביעת תעריף לעובד קיים ששינה את מקום מגוריו`

-- akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3 The heading; its clauses follow.

-- 2.3.1: the employee must tell human resources of a new address or
-- workplace; farther from work, the supplement of 1.8.2022 is kept without
-- recalculation (2.3.1.1); nearer, the new tariffs "משולב מלא" alone, no
-- supplement (2.3.1.2).
@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-1
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `travel-allowance duty`
DECIDE `reporting a move, notice 19` IS
    PARTY `the government employee`
    MUST  `report the new address or workplace on the travel-allowance form`

@ref akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-1__pnt_2-3-1-1 akn:hc_1__para_2__subpara_2-3__cls_2-3-1__pnt_2-3-1-2
GIVEN `the supplement of 1.8.2022` IS A NUMBER
      `the move is nearer` IS A BOOLEAN @desc to the workplace, by the reform's distance bands
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `notice 19's supplement after a move` `the supplement of 1.8.2022` `the move is nearer` IS
    IF `the move is nearer` THEN 0 ELSE `the supplement of 1.8.2022`

§§ `3 נסיעות בתפקיד`

-- 3.1: trips on duty are refunded only where the employee must go out of
-- the city of home or work: at the tariff of the means used, up to the daily
-- pass "משולב חלקי" or "משולב מלא", up to 1,000 shekels a month with a
-- service car (3.1.1), 1,500 with no car standard, by the attendance report
-- (3.1.2). 3.1.3: the single trips are reported by annex B.
@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1__cls_3-1-1 akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1__cls_3-1-2
GIVEN `the fares of the trips on duty` IS A NUMBER @desc each trip at its means' tariff, no more than the day's pass
      `has a service car` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `notice 19's refund for trips on duty` `the fares of the trips on duty` `has a service car` IS
    min `the fares of the trips on duty` (IF `has a service car` THEN 1000 ELSE 1500)

@ref akn:hc_1__para_3__subpara_3-1__cls_3-1-3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tariff-notice duty`
DECIDE `reporting trips on duty, notice 19` IS
    PARTY `the salary accountant`
    MUST  `report the single trips on duty`

-- akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-1 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-2 akn:hc_1__para_4__subpara_4-3 The list of annexes; no rule.

§§ `נספח ב — אופן דיווח קצובת נסיעה`

-- akn:att_2__hc_1/p1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1 The annex's title and the heading of its first part; the stages follow.

-- 1.1.1-1.1.3: the distance is taken from the Derech Shava calculator (the
