@ref akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1__cls_1-1-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1__cls_1-1-1__pnt_1-1-1-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1__cls_1-1-1__pnt_1-1-1-1__pnt_1-1-1-1-1 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1__cls_1-1-1__pnt_1-1-1-1__pnt_1-1-1-1-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1__cls_1-1-1__pnt_1-1-1-1__pnt_1-1-1-1-3 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1__cls_1-1-1__pnt_1-1-1-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1__cls_1-1-2 akn:att_2__hc_1__para_1__subpara_1-1__cls_1-1-3
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `tariff-notice duty`
DECIDE `reporting the code, notice 19` IS
    PARTY `the salary accountant`
    MUST  `find the route's tariff code or distance on the Ministry of Transport's calculator`
    HENCE (PARTY `the salary accountant`
           MUST  `report the route's tariff code in the payroll`)

